# Vehicle Testing Dashboard

A simple Dash-Plotly based automotive vehicle testing reporting solution for time-series data.

## Features
- Multiple vehicle support
- Time-series charts for speed, RPM, voltage, current, SOC, temperatures, and regenerative braking
- Date-range filtering
- KPI summary cards
- Min/Avg/Max summary table

## Setup

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python generate_sample_data.py
python app.py
```

Open http://localhost:8050 in your browser.

## Data fields
- timestamp
- timestamp_unix
- vehicle_id
- vehicle_speed_kmh
- e_motor_speed_rpm
- odometer_km
- ignition_state
- battery_voltage_v
- battery_current_a
- battery_temperature_c
- battery_soc_percent
- motor_temperature_c
- motor_current_a
- inverter_temperature_c
- coolant_temperature_c
- throttle_position_pct
- brake_pressure_bar
- steering_angle_deg
- acceleration_ms2
- gear_position
- cabin_temperature_c
- ambient_temperature_c
- tire_pressure_psi
- gps_latitude
- gps_longitude
- test_cycle
- test_status
- regenerative_braking_kw
